  seoTitle="Open a Bank Account in Romania as a Foreigner"
  h1="Opening a Bank Account in Romania as a Foreigner: A Practical Cluj Guide"
  description="Documents Romanian banks typically ask for, student accounts, RON vs EUR, cards and fees, and why branches differ, a practical guide for newcomers in Cluj."
